# Drift baselines stay out of the repo by default: an engagement baseline
# carries that engagement's questions and the model's answers to them. The
# local qwen3 reference is the deliberate exception -- a public model measured
# on a fictional suite, worth versioning so the drift reference is reviewable
# and reproducible elsewhere (D-048).
/baselines/*
!/baselines/qwen3-8b-nightly.json
